divergence.broiler-js: row S3: 512 and 1,000 nested (?:, (, (?= and v-mode [, by the constructor, a literal and an exec; Broiler.JS answers accepted at every depth: it sets no nesting limit; engine policy that becomes a parameter (JSD-0081 decision D7: a nesting limit of 512 in both engines, the SyntaxError this vector's per-engine field holds); answered by SJL-11.5, which passes Broiler.Regex that limit
